      *  Production line 264 WHEN TRNSRCI = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES fires:
      *  WS-ERR-FLG='Y', TRNSRCL=-1.  TC9 covers the THIRD WHEN.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COTRN02C VALIDATE-INPUT-DATA-FIELDS rejects empty src'
            MOVE '01' TO TTYPCDI OF COTRN2AI
            MOVE '0001' TO TCATCDI OF COTRN2AI
            MOVE SPACES TO TRNSRCI OF COTRN2AI
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
