      ******************************************************************
      *  TC14 -- VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS routes ACCT-ID to lookup
      *  Production lines 196-209 fire when ACTIDINI is non-empty
      *  numeric.  This drives the COMPUTE WS-ACCT-ID-N + READ-
      *  CXACAIX-FILE chain.  WS-RESP-CD initial 0=DFHRESP(NORMAL)
      *  takes line-589 NORMAL arm (CONTINUE) so no error flag set.
      *
      *  BMS field ACTIDINI is PIC X(11) so MOVE of '00000012345' is
      *  legal and FUNCTION NUMVAL converts to 12345 numeric value.
      *  The READ-CXACAIX-FILE EXEC CICS READ is intercepted by the
      *  DFHEI1 mock; WS-RESP-CD remains 0.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COTRN02C VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS reads CXACAIX OK'
            MOVE '00000012345' TO ACTIDINI OF COTRN2AI
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS
            EXPECT WS-ERR-FLG TO BE 'N'
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC15 -- VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS routes CARD to lookup
      *  Production lines 210-223 fire when ACTIDINI is empty AND
      *  CARDNINI is non-empty numeric.  Drives the COMPUTE
      *  WS-CARD-NUM-N + READ-CCXREF-FILE chain.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COTRN02C VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS reads CCXREF OK'
            MOVE SPACES TO ACTIDINI OF COTRN2AI
            MOVE '0123456789012345' TO CARDNINI OF COTRN2AI
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS
            EXPECT WS-ERR-FLG TO BE 'N'
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC16 -- READ-CXACAIX-FILE NORMAL response (line 589).
      *  WS-RESP-CD=0 takes line-589 NORMAL arm (CONTINUE).  No error
      *  flag set; ACTIDINL not modified by NORMAL arm.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COTRN02C READ-CXACAIX-FILE NORMAL response'
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE 0 TO WS-RESP-CD
            PERFORM READ-CXACAIX-FILE
            EXPECT WS-ERR-FLG TO BE 'N'
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

